node_modules
.remotion

# Renders are gigabytes and are rebuilt from source, so out/ stays out of the
# repository — except the previews, which are the only viewable record of what
# a delivered asset looks like.
#
# The negation has to be written against out/* rather than out/. Git does not
# descend into an excluded DIRECTORY, so `out` followed by `!out/_previews`
# silently kept ignoring everything: the reel that was already tracked went on
# working and the two new ones next to it could not be added at all.
out/*
!out/_previews/
